I finally got it, playing as 'F'. Not that many points (~75,000), but
I was just playing for the fun of it. 
The spoiler: On the way back, since you (probably) have a lot of Str. 
and HP, try killing shopkeepers... almost all had 2,000-4,000 gold   
points. I know it decreases luck et. al, but it's quite rewarding. At
the end, I could take 'em with 2-3 blows.
Also, be aware of the effects of random teleportation after eating 'L's.
It was MOST annoying in the maze, until i got the ring of teleport control...
Happy hacking!

